sion and use of data. Technology is moving fast, and we cover exciting new developments that have an impact on digital preservation and access.0 aMay 31, 2011; title from blogs home page caption (LC, viewed June 11, 2026).1 aJune 10, 2026 (LC, viewed June 11, 2026). 0aDigital preservationzUnited StatesvBlogs. 7aBlogs.2fast0(OCoLC)fst016928252 aLibrary of Congress,epublisher.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n7808903540uhttps://purl.fdlp.gov/GPO/gpo257124704 zAddress at time of PURL creationuhttps://blogs.loc.gov/thesignal/  aC0bGPO  abc103 20260611b20260611  aCONSERNEWb20260611  aUNREPORTEDPUBSASKGPOb20260611  aVEND01b2026062403062cam a2200445 a 00147466220260611170926.0he bmb020baca860513s1981    dcu     b    f000 0 eng d  a1060668939a1304947688  a(OCoLC)13562558z(OCoLC)1060668939z(OCoLC)1304947688  aAKRbengcAKRdOCLdOCLCQdAMAZNdFTUBLdOCLCQdOCLCFdOCLCOdOCLCQdWYUdN#VdOCLCQdOCLCLdGPO  an-us---  aXZLM 4aKF49  a1038-B (MF)04a353.84qOCoLC219/eng/202302161https://id.oclc.org/worldcat/ddc/E44HRTxf9DtFMWR6VjRBQqXtCc0 aY 4.F 49:B 721 aUnited States.bCongress.bSenate.bCommittee on Finance.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n7808897510aNominations of Lawrence J. Brady, David R. Macdonald, Pamela Needham Bailey, Robert J. Rubin, and Richard Kusserow :bhearing before the Committee on Finance, United States Senate, Ninety-seventh Congress, first session, on nominations of Lawrence J. Brady to be assistant secretary of commerce, David R. Macdonald to be deputy United States trade representative, Pamela Needham Bailey to be assistant secretary of health and human services, Robert J. Rubin to be assistant secretary of health and human services, Richard Kusserow to be inspector general, Department of Health and Human Services, May 22, 1981. 1aWashington :bU.S. G.P.O.,c1981.  aiii, 60 pages ;c24 cm  atextbtxt2rdacontent  amicroformbh2rdamedia  amicrofichebhe2rdacarrier  